msgid "Carpeted in snow, the land slumbers in repose, but this fragile peace is destined to be shattered - and not by spring. Large packs of wolves lurk in the wild searching for prey, a lone arctic fox scurries away to hide. Starting in this seemingly hostile terrain, players must conquer - or be conquered."
