msgid "Lush grasslands carpet the land, in places giving way to magnificent and diverse broadleaf forests. Poplars, pines, beeches and oaks all vie for supremacy but this root-war is a neverending struggle. Numerous apple trees dot the land, deer and sheep gorge themselves on this years fallen fruit."
